{"channelId":"UC5QliCzSw2PetvyaotFTHNQ","row":["Wild Sun Bodywork Therapy",424,"Hi, I'm Robin, Licensed Massage & Bodywork Therapist and Certified Tension & Trauma Releasing Exercise® Provider. This channel is my space to share educational videos and peeks into what my real treatments look like. You'll find therapy videos, unintentional asmr, aromatherapy tutorials, reactions, self-care practices, and TRE®. \n\nMy clinic in western North Carolina has some availability for in-person appointments, and I provide Tension & Trauma Releasing Exercises® appointments via Zoom. Reach out at wildsunbodywork@gmail.com\n\n~ New videos every Wednesday at 3 pm eastern standard time ~\n\nNC LMBT #23605\n\n**Watching YouTube videos and participating in guided self-care routines is not a substitute for medical advice from your physician or hands-on treatment from a licensed therapist, and does not establish a therapist-client relationship. If you’ve got a condition or injury, consult your healthcare providers~ that’s what we’re here for!","wildsunbodywork@gmail.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5QliCzSw2PetvyaotFTHNQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5QliCzSw2PetvyaotFTHNQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:35.057Z","channelId":"UC5QliCzSw2PetvyaotFTHNQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"2cee3de5e158d4cc8070fbeab92da922aaf542d14d34b7662f5a417452bbe28b","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"dbc7534e9380b5e456ed15fc0321e3188532ad140ef2e97354827f83be994697"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5QliCzSw2PetvyaotFTHNQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:35.057Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5QliCzSw2PetvyaotFTHNQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":424,"raw":"424 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5QliCzSw2PetvyaotFTHNQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:35.057Z"}],"emails":[{"